{"4657370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hotel Manager: Together", "steam_appid": 4657370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4783230], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teamwork makes the dream hotel work!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the ultimate hospitality challenge. In this fast-paced, arcade-idle management game, you are not alone! Grab your friends and dive into a hilariously chaotic 1-4 player online co-op experience where every second counts. Will you build a 5-star empire, or will your guests leave one-star reviews?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/bd038550b2a276baabf10d75d05132d2.poster.avif?t=1782547380\" width=868 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/bd038550b2a276baabf10d75d05132d2.webm?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/bd038550b2a276baabf10d75d05132d2.mp4?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Co-op Madness (1-4 Players)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing a hotel is tough, but doing it with your friends is pure, unadulterated chaos! Play solo or form a crew of up to 4 players online. Shout at your friends to clean Room 204, coordinate who handles the reception, and watch out for your buddy who is hopelessly lost carrying 20 rolls of toilet paper. Communication is key, but panic is guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Zero to 5-Star Hero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a cheap, one-room motel in the middle of nowhere and build your way up to a neon-lit, multi-story luxury resort. Use your hard-earned cash to unlock new rooms, upgrade furniture, and expand your facilities. Adding pools, gyms, and premium dining areas will attract wealthier guests—but they’ll demand faster service!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/3332376dc13f14311fc7be8ed2ca636a.poster.avif?t=1782547380\" width=558 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/3332376dc13f14311fc7be8ed2ca636a.webm?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/3332376dc13f14311fc7be8ed2ca636a.mp4?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Divide, Conquer, and Serve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is always something to do! To keep the cash flowing, your team needs to master multitasking:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reception:</strong> Keep the queue moving. Nobody likes waiting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Housekeeping:</strong> Guests leave a mess. Sprint to clean rooms and make the beds before the next arrival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restocking:</strong> Keep the supply closets full of towels, toilet paper, and room service items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VIP Treatment:</strong> Watch out for special guests who drop massive tips but demand instant attention.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/f34a61287419caeaf02849492717c80a.poster.avif?t=1782547380\" width=486 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/f34a61287419caeaf02849492717c80a.webm?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/f34a61287419caeaf02849492717c80a.mp4?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop-in/Drop-out Online Multiplayer:</strong> Seamlessly join your friends' hotels or host your own up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Arcade-Idle Loop:</strong> Addictive, fast-paced gameplay where there is always an upgrade waiting just around the corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Upgrades:</strong> Unlock new floors, luxury amenities, and staff assistants to automate the tedious tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Crew:</strong> Unlock hilarious hats and uniforms to stand out in the lobby.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teamwork makes the dream hotel work!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the ultimate hospitality challenge. In this fast-paced, arcade-idle management game, you are not alone! Grab your friends and dive into a hilariously chaotic 1-4 player online co-op experience where every second counts. Will you build a 5-star empire, or will your guests leave one-star reviews?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/bd038550b2a276baabf10d75d05132d2.poster.avif?t=1782547380\" width=868 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/bd038550b2a276baabf10d75d05132d2.webm?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/bd038550b2a276baabf10d75d05132d2.mp4?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Co-op Madness (1-4 Players)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing a hotel is tough, but doing it with your friends is pure, unadulterated chaos! Play solo or form a crew of up to 4 players online. Shout at your friends to clean Room 204, coordinate who handles the reception, and watch out for your buddy who is hopelessly lost carrying 20 rolls of toilet paper. Communication is key, but panic is guaranteed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Zero to 5-Star Hero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a cheap, one-room motel in the middle of nowhere and build your way up to a neon-lit, multi-story luxury resort. Use your hard-earned cash to unlock new rooms, upgrade furniture, and expand your facilities. Adding pools, gyms, and premium dining areas will attract wealthier guests—but they’ll demand faster service!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/3332376dc13f14311fc7be8ed2ca636a.poster.avif?t=1782547380\" width=558 height=516 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/3332376dc13f14311fc7be8ed2ca636a.webm?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/3332376dc13f14311fc7be8ed2ca636a.mp4?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Divide, Conquer, and Serve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is always something to do! To keep the cash flowing, your team needs to master multitasking:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reception:</strong> Keep the queue moving. Nobody likes waiting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Housekeeping:</strong> Guests leave a mess. Sprint to clean rooms and make the beds before the next arrival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restocking:</strong> Keep the supply closets full of towels, toilet paper, and room service items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VIP Treatment:</strong> Watch out for special guests who drop massive tips but demand instant attention.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/f34a61287419caeaf02849492717c80a.poster.avif?t=1782547380\" width=486 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/f34a61287419caeaf02849492717c80a.webm?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4657370/extras/f34a61287419caeaf02849492717c80a.mp4?t=1782547380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop-in/Drop-out Online Multiplayer:</strong> Seamlessly join your friends' hotels or host your own up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying Arcade-Idle Loop:</strong> Addictive, fast-paced gameplay where there is always an upgrade waiting just around the corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Upgrades:</strong> Unlock new floors, luxury amenities, and staff assistants to automate the tedious tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Crew:</strong> Unlock hilarious hats and uniforms to stand out in the lobby.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Build your own hotel empi